{"parse": {"title": "11TH-13", "pageid": 110481, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-12\" title=\"11TH-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-13</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-14\" title=\"11TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">13</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.92.8C.E5.B9.B3.E7.9A.84.E4.BB.B7.E7.A0.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"和平的价码\">和平的价码</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 和平的价码</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Concessions for Peace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弥<span class=\"color-value\"></span>补<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>太<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>代<span class=\"color-value\"></span>价<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11113</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>留在安全区内待命的“Ⅻ”小队成员百无聊赖地执行着烦琐的指令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在一扇窗前驻足，眯着眼向室内看去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zongmaolaozhaiwunei\"><img alt=\"zongmaolaozhaiwunei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png/600px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png/900px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png/1200px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaiwunei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线所及之处，只有破损的家具残骸。几盏打碎的瓷器上已结成蛛网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一台造型独特的反制神秘术监测设备正立在未经清理的地面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-524112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>——完全没有打扫过嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>护卫兵打开窗，将身子探进去，面罩帮助她隔绝了大多数灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>按照长官的指示，她拿出一张透明的布条，放置在神秘学设备边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>布条很快显露出颜色，一行小字在其上浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>“反制设备运行正常”——看来没有我的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻窗而出。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_anquanqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_anquanqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-524101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>唔，嘿——嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……梅蕾尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>玛尔纱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻士兵噌的一下站起来上前迎接，她长出一口气，看起来如释重负。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>你终于……回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>帕拉维扬还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>病床上躺着呢，累得够呛，但至少没有缺胳膊少腿，应该很快就能恢复了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>他说农庄那边收获不算太大，帕拉维扬带人去检查了一番，除了装甲车之外，没有特别多的重要信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>幸好，玛丽安娜和我们去了同一个地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>所以，真的是她——刺杀希施费尔德上校的凶手？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>对，她给了我一大批有关重塑之手的情报，我已经送给刻雷乌斯长官了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>至于刺杀事件，是一场误会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>误会？——可她……杀了人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>说到这个，我也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士无意识地用拇指揉搓着掌心的缺口——旧伤已经很久没有痒过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抿着嘴唇，连带着在面罩上挤出一条扭曲的细缝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>好吧，我……总之，我担心你会出什么事，就像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>就像？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>就像查尔斯和阿曼达。4个小时前，他们和安全区失去了联系，已经好一阵子没有收到他们的回报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……是去299高地侦查的小队？派出救援了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>刻雷乌斯长官已经派人去打探情况了，应该很快就会有结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>至于其他的调查员小队，大多数都有了消息，还有几个已经带着不少线索回到安全区了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我们应该……不用再出任务了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻士兵小心翼翼地看着玛尔纱，像是在等她说出一个肯定的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>前线每天都在被炮火轰炸，如果一不小心……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱拍了拍她的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>玛丽安娜分享的线索非常充分，等到联系上299高地的小队，我们差不多能收工了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>别太害怕了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱递交来的证物照片副本在桌面上排开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>私人信件、带有标记的军用地图、作战计划书、工程蓝图，以及被污损与篡改的证件……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一同被放在桌面上的，还有来自其他调查员从前线各地找回的物证。它们按照从1918年开始的时间顺序粗略排列着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>不……难以置信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>议员代表紧盯着桌面的众多图片，洪水般涌来的信息在一瞬间击溃了他的理解能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>这些资料中的内容竟与最荒唐的阴谋论调完全吻合……之前的多次和谈确实是在重塑之手的计划下破产的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>在这之后的战争……双方都不断陷入明显的陷阱……1919年末的那场惨败之后，获胜方也意外地没有扩大战果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我的老天……这意味着，重塑之手在向双方提供援助和情报，以此不让任何一方取胜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-526111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-526111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-526111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>——合谋。战争不过是重塑之手在控制军队之后展开的屠杀。我如何才能想象到这么荒唐的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>政客猛地抬头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-512201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-512201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-512201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>这不是一个国家的事，在如此充分的证据面前，大半个欧洲的军队高层都要倒台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我们甚至已经有了一份足够详尽的名单，只要动作够快，我们有希望将这些出卖国家的叛徒全部逮捕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等到格奥尔格的情绪相对稳定，刻雷乌斯才补上一句建议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>受到精神影响的军官和士兵，可以交由科算中心治疗。艾伯哈特的例子证明这种影响是可以被消除的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>没错，没错——不能再等了。现在是行动的时刻，首相与议会已经做好了发动致命一击的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在宏伟前景的光照下，议员代表的双手开始颤抖，几乎无法抓稳手中的纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>证据已经足够，我们的确没有必要再等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>当然，这很好……！重返家园的士兵们会感谢我们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-526101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格奥尔格：</div><div>我们将为欧洲留下一个世纪的和平！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>不错，这听起来像是一句能够被历史铭记的名言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>议员代表没有心思在乎刻雷乌斯最后这句有些辛辣味的评论，他将所有文件都塞进公文包，匆匆离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刻雷乌斯将桌上剩余的凌散文件整理好，从桌面下方拿出一台通讯器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它已经被接通了很长一段时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>……一切都在按计划进行。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>很好，其他地区的负责人也已经通过相同的方式，向主和派政要分享了情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>基金会现在只需留意是否有重塑之手的人员出面干预。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>可是……用这种方式推动和谈是否会带来更大的动荡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一次，身处副会长办公室的不再是两位立场相悖的委员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我只是恰好在旁听，刻雷乌斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>原来如此……这个结局不会比我们眼下经历的战争更糟了，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>拿真实历史的记载来说，这场大战曾造成千万名士兵的死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>受战争直接或间接影响而死亡的平民人数也与之相当。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>现在，我们处在错谬历史之下的1920年，死亡数字也许只会有增无减。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>——我们已经促成了一个相对较好的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我能理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>总之，战争结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>主和派上台之后，蒙佩会成为下一次停火协定的签订地点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>也许现在说这个有些不合时宜，不过，我想问……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>如果基金会最终没能阻止重塑之手的谋划，委员会有没有商讨出可以执行的备选方案？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间中的沉默印证了通讯另一头的猜想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……你发现什么异常了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前执夜人尽可能地从回忆中捞起一些可疑的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>这要回到希施费尔德的问题上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-523721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>你们是否记得玛尔纱提交报告的一处细节……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_gongmu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_gongmu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>也许在你们看来，他的死导致前线战火重燃，可是……即使我不杀他，谈判也注定会失败。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>如果这是一场注定失败的谈判，重塑之手又为何让希施费尔德冒着暴露的风险，同意与基金会的人员在蒙佩接触？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>换句话说，如果希施费尔德不被刺杀，这场停火谈判是否会成为一场漫长而无果的交涉拉锯战？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>重塑之手在配合基金会做一件注定失败的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凭借与重塑之手接触的经验，一种直觉式的猜想很快被构建起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……他们在吸引基金会的注意力？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>这也是我的猜测，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">刻雷乌斯：</div><div>不过……现在没有任何事情，比即将到来的和平还要重要。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-13"}}